          "guid": "mssbsd45aqzw00ue",
          "message": {
            "text": "This regression deliberately asserts Blink's captured used boxes before inspecting output markup, proving Domotion preserves layout results instead of recomputing flex/grid sizing from intrinsic image ratios. The current 15-deep-flex-aspect-ratio fixture already emits its replaced images at 120×120 and 240×120; its sole remaining localized region is text at y=931, so no renderer sizing change is justified.",
            "markdown": "This regression deliberately asserts Blink's captured used boxes before inspecting output markup, proving Domotion preserves layout results instead of recomputing flex/grid sizing from intrinsic image ratios. The current 15-deep-flex-aspect-ratio fixture already emits its replaced images at 120×120 and 240×120; its sole remaining localized region is text at y=931, so no renderer sizing change is justified."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tests/replaced-used-size.e2e.test.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 58,
                  "endLine": 76,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "describeBrowser(\"DM-2162: replaced elements retain Blink's flex/grid used size\", () => {\n  it(\"passes the captured used boxes unchanged to raster and inline-SVG paint\", async () => {\n    const page = await env!.browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: W, height: H }, deviceScaleFactor: 1 });\n    try {\n      await page.setContent(HTML, { waitUntil: \"load\" });\n      const tree = await captureElementTree(page, \"body\", { x: 0, y: 0, width: W, height: H });\n      const captured = images(tree);\n\n      expect(captured).toHaveLength(3);\n      expect(captured.map(({ x, y, width, height }) => ({ x, y, width, height }))).toEqual([\n        { x: 0, y: 0, width: 120, height: 120 },\n        { x: 130, y: 0, width: 240, height: 120 },\n        { x: 0, y: 160, width: 220, height: 90 },\n      ]);\n\n      const output = elementTreeToSvgInner(tree, W, H);\n      expect(output).toMatch(/<image\\b[^>]*x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"/);\n      expect(output).toMatch(/<image\\b[^>]*x=\"130\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"120\"/);\n      expect(output).toMatch(/<svg\\b[^>]*x=\"0\" y=\"160\" width=\"220\" height=\"90\"/);"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "test-evidence"
            ],
            "ext-ai-tool-confidence": 0.99
          },
